# Divine Journey 2 Modern - added content (not present in the original pack).
# Modular Machinery modifier descriptions (English). This is not a Minecraft lang
# file: the mod stores the JSON description as a literal string, and
# MachineModifierDescriptionI18n.groovy reads this file and swaps the keys for text.
# When adding a machine, add modularmachinery.<registryname>.modifier.<name>.desc=...

modularmachinery.lightningcraft_infusion_multiblock.modifier.wireless_block.desc=Replace the §eSkyfather Air Terminal§r with an §eLE Receiver (Tier 3)§r to decrease the energy cost by 50%.
modularmachinery.lightningcraft_infusion_multiblock.modifier.mystic_cell.desc=Replace the §eAdvanced Lightning Cell§r with a §eMystic Lightning Cell§r to multiply the processing speed by 2.
modularmachinery.lightningcraft_infusion_multiblock.modifier.rf_generator.desc=Replace the §eAdvanced Lightning Cell§r with an §eRF Lightning Generator§r to multiply the processing speed by 5.
modularmachinery.mob_loot_fabricator.modifier.celestial_crystal.desc=Note: The §eCelestial Collector Crystal§r must be attuned to §eLucerna§r for the multiblock to form.
modularmachinery.chemical_caster.modifier.celestial_crystal_core.desc=Replace Crystal Cores with Celestial Crystal Cores for 10x recipe speeds at 10x the energy cost.
modularmachinery.weak_fusion_plant.modifier.reinforced_machine_accelerator.desc=Replace 3 Machine Circuitry inside with Reinforced Machine Accelerators for 10x recipe speeds at 10x the energy cost.
modularmachinery.noel357_bottler.modifier.reinforced_machine_accelerator.desc=Replace the §eAcceleration Rune§r with a §eReinforced Machine Accelerator§r for 8x recipe speeds at 8x the energy cost.
